SH.06 · We now hold three sets of human moves. Any of them may be empty. They are either all reconstructed from cache or all produced by the fresh path; cached and fresh sets are not combined. On the fresh path, a successful masters answer also carries the opening name and code. On the cached path it does not. ^ZIVCeO1j

